<ul>
    <li>% Max Downline: the maximum position taking given to an agent. It is set by direct
        upline agent.</li>
    <li>% Min Downline: the minimum position taking which an agent and its downline agents
        must cover. It is set by direct upline agent.</li>
    <li>[x - y]: input range.</li>
</ul>
<p>
    <span class="note">Note:</span> only allow two numbers after the decimal point.
    For instance, 10.25 is a valid input, but 10.555 is not.
</p>